em pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Toshwash.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/2b/Toshwash..png/revision/latest?cb=20210212051200\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Toshwash.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/2b/Toshwash..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210212051200\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/2b/Toshwash..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210212051200 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/2b/Toshwash..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210212051200 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Toshwash.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Toshwash..png\" data-image-name=\"Toshwash..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_10\" title=\"Series 10\">10</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Daisy_May_Cooper\" title=\"Daisy May Cooper\">Daisy May Cooper</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Point_of_swivel.\" title=\"Point of swivel.\">Point of swivel.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/I_hate_your_trainers.\" title=\"I hate your trainers.\">I hate your trainers.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Toshwash.</b></i> is the fourth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_10\" title=\"Series 10\">Series 10</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 5 November 2020. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Daisy_May_Cooper\" title=\"Daisy May Cooper\">Daisy May Cooper</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Toshwash.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Toshwash\" was a word used by Richard the security guard to describe <a href=\"/wiki/Richard_Herring\" title=\"Richard Herring\">Richard Herring</a>'s argument in the <a href=\"/wiki/Persuade_the_security_guard_to_look_in_your_bag\" title=\"Persuade the security guard to look in your bag\">Persuade the security guard to look in your bag</a> task. The statue used by both <a href=\"/wiki/Richard_Herring\" title=\"Richard Herring\">Richard Herring</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Katherine_Parkinson\" title=\"Katherine Parkinson\">Katherine Parkinson</a> in the security guard task casts a shadow on a balloon in the episode's title card. The balloon alludes to the <a href=\"/wiki/Drop_this_water_balloon_from_the_greatest_height_without_it_bursting\" title=\"Drop this water balloon from the greatest height without it bursting\">Drop this water balloon from the greatest height without it bursting</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Toshwash.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Det rene pladder', which translates as 'It's pure jabber'. In Danish, to say that someone 'pladdrar' means that they're talking nonsense.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Hyllynpylly'. 'Hyllynpylly' is apparently a nonsense word; the closest actual word to it - 'hyllypylly' - basically means 'lardass'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Utmaning utan mottagning', which translates as 'Challenge without reception'. This title is catchier in Swedish, because it rhymes. It's unclear what it might be a reference to - perhaps the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_this_phone_ring\" title=\"Make this phone ring\">Make this phone ring</a> task?<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Toshwash.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Daisy_May_Cooper\" title=\"Daisy May Cooper\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Daisy May Cooper</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Johnny_Vegas\" title=\"Johnny Vegas\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Johnny Vegas</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Katherine_Parkinson\" title=\"Katherine Parkinson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Katherine Parkinson</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mawaan_Rizwan\" title=\"Mawaan Rizwan\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mawaan Rizwan</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Richard_Herring\" title=\"Richard Herring\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Richard Herring</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Cheekiest_food\" title=\"Cheekiest food\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Cheekiest food.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_this_phone_ring\" title=\"Make this phone ring\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make this phone ring.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Persuade_the_security_guard_to_look_in_your_bag\" title=\"Persuade the security guard to look in your bag\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Secretly put something that looks amazing in your bag.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">0\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">0\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">0\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Persuade the security guard to look in your bag. You may describe what is in your bag, but you must not say what is in your bag.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Drop_this_water_balloon_from_the_greatest_height_without_it_bursting\" title=\"Drop this water balloon from the greatest height without it bursting\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Drop this water balloon from the greatest height without it bursting. You may not damage the water balloon or remove any water from it.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Roll_an_edible_sphere_across_the_finish_line\" title=\"Roll an edible sphere across the finish line\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Roll an edible sphere across the finish line. The person whose edible sphere crosses the finish line first, each round, is eliminated. If your edible sphere stops moving before the finishing line, you are eliminated.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">19\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td>13\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Toshwash.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Trivia\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>This is the second episode with a title first said by someone other than the main cast, after <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pork_is_a_sausage.\" title=\"Pork is a sausage.\">Pork is a sausage.</a></span>, in this case said by Richard the security guard.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Toshwash.?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/toshwash\"><i>Toshwash.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/70911-004\"><i>Toshwash.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141503\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.109 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.164 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 626/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25821/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 202/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 800474/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   97.491      1 -